<title>USA: Fifth Third completes Suburban merge.</title>
<headline>Fifth Third completes Suburban merge.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fifth Third Bancorp said Friday it completed of the acquisition of Cincinnati-headquartered Suburban Bancorp's seven offices, $220 million in assets, $129 million in deposits and $27.6 million in equity as of June 30.</p>
<p>Fifth Third said that with this acquisition, it will add 19,000 new customers and 22,000 new accounts.</p>
<p>As previously announced, the purchase of Suburban was worth $31.8 million.</p>
